                    <li><strong>Revolut:</strong> Real-time currency conversion, crypto access, stock trading, and budgeting tools.</li>
                    <li><strong>N26:</strong> Digital-first European bank with sleek UX and fee-free international spending.</li>
                    <li><strong>Payoneer:</strong> Used by freelancers receiving payments from global platforms.</li>
                  </ul>
                  
                  <p>
                    Some nomads maintain a "home base" bank in their country of origin while using fintech accounts for daily expenses.
                  </p>
                  
