                      <p>Use bodyweight workouts, travel-friendly equipment, or local yoga studios. Apps like Fitbod and Nike Training Club are useful.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div>
                      <h5 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Nutrition</h5>
                      <p>Maintain a balance of local cuisine and whole foods. Many cook at home or prep simple meals.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div>
                      <h5 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Sleep Hygiene</h5>
