                    </div>
                    
                    <div>
                      <h5 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Mental Health</h5>
                      <p>Isolation, anxiety, and decision fatigue are common. Many use tools like BetterHelp or join peer-support communities.</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div>
                      <h5 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Regular Checkups</h5>
