                  </p>
                  
                  <ul class="space-y-3 list-disc pl-6">
                    <li><strong>Starlink & Satellite Internet:</strong> High-speed access in remote or rural areas, from Patagonia to the Himalayas.</li>
                    <li><strong>AI Productivity Tools:</strong> Virtual assistants, smart scheduling, and creative support from tools like ChatGPT and Notion AI.</li>
                    <li><strong>VR Collaboration:</strong> Virtual offices and co-presence tools may replace video calls.</li>
                    <li><strong>Decentralized Finance (DeFi):</strong> Borderless banking, crypto salaries, and DAO-based communities.</li>
                  </ul>
                  
                  <p>
